, running Ubuntu 24.04 LTS. A single run of PPO in HalfCheetah-v5 considering the hyperparameters of Table 2 takes ≈ 25 \approx 25 minutes. Additionally, in the same setting, a run of ω \omega PPO-BH and ω \omega PPO-U with ω = 4 \omega=4 in the fixed B B scenario takes ≈ 50 \approx 50 minutes, while for fixed N ℬ N_{\mathcal{B}} scenario it takes ≈ 35 \approx 35 minutes. LLMs Usage. We employed LLMs mainly as aid for editing purposes, for checking proof correctness, and for assistance with code.
